# IDE / agent tooling
.vscode/
.windsurf/
# Claude Code writes a local settings file (permission allowlists, machine
# state) wherever it is run from. Untracked but unignored, it sat one
# `git add -A` away from a public repo — and nested copies appear under any
# subdirectory a session was started in.
**/.claude/

# Local-only operational docs. Public repo: console URLs, ports and reachability
# are a recon shortcut and belong with the item-24 decision (operational detail
# stays readable locally, not published). Never commit this directory.
docs/local/

